<title>INDIA: India 91-day t-bill auction for 3.0 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India 91-day t-bill auction for 3.0 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it will hold an auction of 91-day treasury bills worth three billion rupees on July 11.</p>
<p>Bids should be submitted before 1430 hours on Friday, the RBI said in a statement. Results will be announced the same day and payment by successful bidders will be on Saturday, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
